* From C. L. Baker, "JOSS: Scenario of a Filmed Report", RAND RM-4162-PR, June 1964: the film of 21 March 1964, pages 6 to 8 and example 3.
Set k = 2·3.14159265.
1.1 Set F = sqrt[1/(L·C)]/k.
1.2 Set f = sqrt[1/(L·C)-R*2/(4·L*2)]/k.
1.3 Set I = k·F*2·Q/f.
1.4 Set d = .1/f.
1.5 Type F, f, I, d.
Set R = 100.
Set L = .2.
Set C = .5·10*(-6).
Set Q = .001.
Do part 1.
       F =    503.292122
       f =    501.716868
       I =      3.17220634
       d =      1.99315603·10*(-4)
Set d = .0002.
2.1 Type 1000·t, I·exp[-R·t/(2·L)]·sin(k·f·t) in form 3.
Form 3:
__.__ ms.   -_.______ amp.
Do part 2 for t = 0(d)100·d.
